#: src/features/replay/IntensityPanel.tsx
msgid "Wind and rain fields are ERA5 reanalysis on a grid of about 28 km. For intense typhoons it smooths the eye wall: at Haiyan's peak, ERA5's strongest 10 m wind was about a third of the JTWC best-track estimate (0.31×) and under half of JMA's 10-minute estimate (0.42×), and its central pressure was 88 hPa too high. Use the best-track intensity for peak strength and the field for spatial extent and timing."
msgstr "Wind and rain fields are ERA5 reanalysis on a grid of about 28 km. For intense typhoons it smooths the eye wall: at Haiyan's peak, ERA5's strongest 10 m wind was about a third of the JTWC best-track estimate (0.31×) and under half of JMA's 10-minute estimate (0.42×), and its central pressure was 88 hPa too high. Use the best-track intensity for peak strength and the field for spatial extent and timing."

